[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2953783086","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107276#issuecomment-2953783086","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107276","id":2953783086,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wDycu","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-08T08:59:38Z","updated_at":"2025-06-08T09:10:20Z","body":"> The function keyboard_get_label_from_physical should return a string \n\nThis is how it is supposed to work, in case of \"label\" `Key` (which is a 32-bit integer) can contain any Unicode character code and is not limited to enum values.\n\nKey value is formatted like this:\n```\nbits - value\n0-20 - Unicode codepoint or special key index.\n  21 - Reserved.\n  22 - Special key flag (set for special keys, not set for Unicode).\n  23 - Reserved.\n  24 - Control or Command modifier (only used for actions and not events).\n  25 - Shift modifier.\n  26 - Alt/Option modifier.\n  27 - Meta modifier.\n  28 - Control modifier.\n  29 - Keypad modifier (not used).\n  32 - Group modifier (not used).\n  31 - Reserved.\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2953783086/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2953784858","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107276#issuecomment-2953784858","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107276","id":2953784858,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wDy4a","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-08T09:01:59Z","updated_at":"2025-06-08T09:01:59Z","body":"You can use `OS.get_keycode_string(key)` to get string from the `Key`.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2953784858/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2953829142","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107276#issuecomment-2953829142","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107276","id":2953829142,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wD9sW","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-08T09:45:22Z","updated_at":"2025-06-08T09:45:22Z","body":"For the reference, `localized label` is a label on letter keys in non-Latin keyboard layouts, so it's always a single character.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/157fa535-fdf7-468f-a7fb-62d927de8960)\n\nIt's not translating the name of the named keys (like “Control”, “Enter”), for the non-letter keys it's always `keycode == physical_keycode == key_label`.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2953829142/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]